{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00451",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.54,
      "end_seconds": 6.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "Well, um, excuse me, doctor, should I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.47,
      "end_seconds": 13.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "That's alright, take a seat. Tell me why you've come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 18.97,
      "end_seconds": 29.07,
      "duration_seconds": 10.1,
      "text": "Okay, so doctor, I'm just here to help with the details. She's been having pain in my right shoulder, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.9,
      "end_seconds": 36.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "How much is it bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.65,
      "end_seconds": 39.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "I'd say severe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.47,
      "end_seconds": 46.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "Does it happen all the time or in spells?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.67,
      "end_seconds": 55.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "It's a few times a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.7,
      "end_seconds": 59.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Right, does it come along with anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.11,
      "end_seconds": 90.68,
      "duration_seconds": 30.57,
      "text": "Hmm, when it starts I tend to get pain at night when I lie on it as well. The pain at night when I lie on it? That's been for about a week. Oh, and a click in the shoulder. That's been about the same, ten days. I had trouble lifting my arm before. That's settled now, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 92.17,
      "end_seconds": 100.9,
      "duration_seconds": 8.73,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Pressure 120 over 68, oxygen saturation is 99 percent, temp 36.6 degrees, pulse 67."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.86,
      "end_seconds": 102.56,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.96,
      "end_seconds": 107.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Okay, a quick examination now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.27,
      "end_seconds": 118.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "That's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.15,
      "end_seconds": 122.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Bear with me a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.48,
      "end_seconds": 144.36,
      "duration_seconds": 5.88,
      "text": "Lifting the arm to the side is painful between sixty and a hundred twenty degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.17,
      "end_seconds": 147.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Just relax, I'll be quick."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.53,
      "end_seconds": 165.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Neck movements are full and don't reproduce it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.17,
      "end_seconds": 174.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Good, that's the examination. Have you had any fall?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.33,
      "end_seconds": 177.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Nope, no fall."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.88,
      "end_seconds": 184.91,
      "duration_seconds": 5.03,
      "text": "So, any fever, chest pain or numbness in the hand at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.91,
      "end_seconds": 194.32,
      "duration_seconds": 8.41,
      "text": "Hmm, no fever, chest pain or numbness in the hand, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.09,
      "end_seconds": 197.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.13,
      "end_seconds": 199.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "No changes there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.09,
      "end_seconds": 203.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.12,
      "end_seconds": 208.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "No, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.65,
      "end_seconds": 214.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "Alright, what about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.09,
      "end_seconds": 219.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "No, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.14,
      "end_seconds": 236.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Have you had to have anything operated on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.93,
      "end_seconds": 243.55,
      "duration_seconds": 5.62,
      "text": "Just a lump removed from my back, years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.32,
      "end_seconds": 248.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "What medicines do you take regularly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 251.44,
      "end_seconds": 262.55,
      "duration_seconds": 11.11,
      "text": "Glycomet, 500 milligrams, twice a day for my sugar. I take amlodipine, 5 milligrams, maybe, once a day for my pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.26,
      "end_seconds": 268.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Have you got the box or the prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 270.46,
      "end_seconds": 277.26,
      "duration_seconds": 6.8,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. I take paracetamol, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.57,
      "end_seconds": 281.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Okay, do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 282.42,
      "end_seconds": 284.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "It's 500 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.89,
      "end_seconds": 287.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "When did you start it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 289.1,
      "end_seconds": 291.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "About about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.14,
      "end_seconds": 294.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 295.24,
      "end_seconds": 299.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "I smoke about ten cigarettes a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.93,
      "end_seconds": 306.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "Any sport or activity?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.52,
      "end_seconds": 309.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "I play badminton on Sundays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.49,
      "end_seconds": 313.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Anything special about your diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 314.62,
      "end_seconds": 318.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "I try to avoid too much sugar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.48,
      "end_seconds": 324.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "Okay, tell me about your health in general, any ongoing conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 325.21,
      "end_seconds": 330.43,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "Diabetes, for about a year. I've got high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.03,
      "end_seconds": 346.61,
      "duration_seconds": 15.58,
      "text": "Right, so high blood pressure is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Taking everything into account, my working impression is a rotator cuff problem. I can't rule out a pinched nerve in the neck yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 359.97,
      "end_seconds": 373.09,
      "duration_seconds": 13.12,
      "text": "Let's get an ultrasound of the shoulder, for shoulder pain. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 375.0,
      "end_seconds": 376.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "Right, will do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 377.97,
      "end_seconds": 385.09,
      "duration_seconds": 7.12,
      "text": "If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 386.13,
      "end_seconds": 391.37,
      "duration_seconds": 5.24,
      "text": "Oh, um, alright, I know what to look for."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 395.14,
      "end_seconds": 403.82,
      "duration_seconds": 8.68,
      "text": "Book a review in four weeks. Let me check I've been clear. What will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 405.73,
      "end_seconds": 411.73,
      "duration_seconds": 6.0,
      "text": "So, um, I come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 416.46,
      "end_seconds": 420.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Call the clinic if you need us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 422.42,
      "end_seconds": 426.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "I mean, uh, okay, thank you. Bye."
    }
  ]
}